    "category": "Automatic checkweigher",
    "type_designations": ["DACS-G-S015", "DACS-G-S060"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Family of mains-powered, dual-range automatic weighing instruments operating as automatic checkweighers (Category X). Stainless steel construction: fabricated floor-standing frame on adjustable feet carrying the in-feed, weigh and out-feed conveyors (conveyor type and size not restricted); control cabinet behind the conveyors houses the electrical hardware including the ADC board and the dip-switches protecting the legally relevant parameters; jog-dial RCU with LED display, function and numerical keys (may be replaced by a colour touch screen RCU); photocells on the frame for pack detection; printer on the side of the control cabinet. Weighing unit comprises a strain gauge load cell located below the centre of the weigh conveyor. Models are designated DACS-G-S015-xx/xx-xx-x and DACS-G-S060-xx/xx-xx-x, with x reflecting the various configurations."
